b_agricultural_worker_day_test = residual("s35", "on each of some 10 days during the calendar year or the preceding calendar year, each day being in a different calendar week, employed in agricultural labor (including labor performed by an alien referred to in subparagraph (B)) for some portion of the day (whether or not at the same moment of time) 5 or more individuals")
